# Godot's import cache. A clean checkout must build its own (`docs/ACCEPTANCE.md` §4.1); the
# launcher does it.
.godot/
# The launcher's local world saves (`./mineworld-2d`, `--fresh` deletes one).
.save/
# Capture output is scratch, except the preview package, which is the reviewed artefact (ARC-24).
shots/*
!shots/preview/
*.import
